WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:06.080
The Eternals are one of Marvel's strangest&nbsp;
groups, and Thena is one of their most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:12.880
fascinating members. A scholar, a warrior,&nbsp;
and an immortal, her life spans eons. We're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:18.800
here to explain her entire story, from her ancient&nbsp;
origins to her unique relationship to Greek myth.

00:00:19.977 --> 00:00:24.400
The Eternals are an immortal race of&nbsp;
super-beings, created through experiments on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:31.360
early humans. Those experiments were conducted&nbsp;
by a group of ultra-powerful pseudo-deities known&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:37.200
as the Celestials, some of the first creatures&nbsp;
to ever exist in the Marvel universe.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:44.320
The universe itself, called the First Firmament,&nbsp;
created a group of servants. This group soon split&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:51.280
into two: the Aspirants and the Celestials. The&nbsp;
Aspirants were loyal servants, who wished for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:57.040
nothing more than to serve. The Celestials&nbsp;
deviated from the First Firmament's plan, wanting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:02.880
to create lives of their own. This led to a civil&nbsp;
war between the inhabitants of the cosmos. In the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:09.920
end, the Celestials triumphed. The First Firmament&nbsp;
and its Aspirants beat a hasty retreat into other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:15.280
fragmented universes, leaving the Celestials to&nbsp;
tinker with the Marvel Universe as they pleased.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:21.760
The Celestials landed on Earth eons ago and&nbsp;
set to experimenting upon early humanity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.800
What resulted were two offshoot groups:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:32.640
The uniformly beautiful and enormously powerful&nbsp;
Eternals, and the dramatically mutated Deviants.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:38.880
The Deviants' resentment of humanity led to an&nbsp;
adversarial relationship with Earth's inhabitants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:44.480
while their mutation allowed them to build&nbsp;
an advanced civilization in record time. In&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:50.800
short order, the Deviants built a vast and&nbsp;
cruel empire. At the same time, the Eternals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:56.000
voted to remove themselves from humanity, building&nbsp;
isolated cities away from the rest of the world.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:59.520
"We were instructed not to interfere with any&nbsp;
human conflicts unless Deviants are involved."

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:03.440
Both of these outcomes displeased the Celestials,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:08.160
who flooded the Earth upon their return.&nbsp;
Thena, the daughter of Eternals' leader Zuras,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:15.520
who was born as Azura around this time in the city&nbsp;
of Olympia. Though she's thousands of years old,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:19.760
she's considered quite young compared&nbsp;
to many of her immortal brethren.

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:27.520
Jack Kirby created the Eternals with ancient Greek&nbsp;
myths in mind. Icarus became Ikaris. The god of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:34.560
the forge Hephaestus became Phastos. The goddess&nbsp;
Circe became Sersi. To be clear, the Eternals are,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:41.440
in most cases, not the gods they are mistaken&nbsp;
for. Most of those gods actually exist in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:47.600
Marvel universe. One exception is that Sersi&nbsp;
appears to really be the mythical Circe.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:51.520
Generally speaking, though, the Eternals&nbsp;
are frequently confused for their Olympian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:56.720
counterparts. The Eternal known as the&nbsp;
Forgotten One was often mistaken for Hercules,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:00.960
who he's actually been buddies with&nbsp;
since ancient Greece. It follows,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:04.640
then, that Thena, daughter&nbsp;
of an immortal named Zuras,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:09.680
who led a city called Olympia, was mixed up&nbsp;
with the goddess Athena, daughter of Zeus.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:15.600
Centuries ago, the Greek gods decided to put&nbsp;
down roots, only to find the Eternals already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:20.880
established in Olympia. The two groups&nbsp;
met and noticed the striking resemblance.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:26.320
A deal was struck in which the Eternals would act&nbsp;
as the Greek pantheon's representatives on Earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:30.400
They would visit with humanity in the&nbsp;
gods' stead, leaving the deities to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:35.520
their pocket dimension of Mount Olympus.&nbsp;
To seal the deal, Zuras decreed that his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:41.680
daughter's name would change from Azura to&nbsp;
Thena. She came to be worshiped as Athena,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:48.400
goddess of wisdom, war, and handicraft. She even&nbsp;
inspired the construction of the city of Athens.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.600
The name stuck with her, and&nbsp;
she's continued to use it.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:56.800
Thena might not be as much of a&nbsp;
dyed-in-the-wool pacifist as Phastos,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.800 --> 00:04:01.600
but she does view the fighting between the&nbsp;
Eternals and the Deviants to be essentially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:08.880
pointless. That viewpoint only grew stronger&nbsp;
when she met and fell for a Deviant named Kro.

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:14.560
Kro and Thena met in ancient Babylon, where&nbsp;
Kro had an opportunity to slay Thena. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:21.040
refused. Love grew between the two, but Kro and&nbsp;
Thena knew to keep their relationship secret.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:27.120
Their partnership is known to few, even as&nbsp;
it carried on for thousands of years. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:32.320
eventually had children together, after reigniting&nbsp;
their relationship during the Vietnam War.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:38.480
Using her Eternal powers, Thena implanted&nbsp;
the resulting twin children in a human woman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:43.680
to continue to keep the relationship secret.&nbsp;
They were born as Deborah and Donald Ritter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:49.600
seemingly ordinary humans. As Eternal-Deviant&nbsp;
hybrids, they were anything but.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:55.360
Having to keep up appearances of fighting an&nbsp;
eternal war while secretly being in love with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.360 --> 00:05:02.000
your supposed enemy takes its toll. At times,&nbsp;
Kro's actions brought Thena and Kro into direct&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:07.360
conflict. Kro attacked New York City, leading&nbsp;
bands of Deviants through the city streets.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:10.640
Zuras knew that he would have&nbsp;
to fight the Deviants yet again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:14.240
and sent his daughter to help&nbsp;
put down the Deviant uprising.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:18.000
Though Thena was ultimately successful&nbsp;
in stopping the Deviant attack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.920
Kro still believed he accomplished&nbsp;
his goals. The Deviants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:26.720
deeply hated the Celestials after years&nbsp;
of being treated as second-class beings.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:33.440
They believed that their attacks would inspire a&nbsp;
widespread hatred of anything from outer space.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:37.428
Feeling that he had done what he set out&nbsp;
to, Kro accepted a truce with the Eternals.

00:05:37.428 --> 00:05:41.520
Leading the Eternals
When the Celestials came to Earth once again, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:48.560
leader of the Eternals made a shocking decision:&nbsp;
He attacked them. Zuras believed the Celestials&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:54.240
would destroy all of humanity if they found Earth&nbsp;
lacking. All of the world's semi-immortal beings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:59.360
including the Asgardians, worked to turn&nbsp;
back the Celestials for their own reasons.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:03.760
When the Eternals formed the Uni-Mind,&nbsp;
a merging of their consciousnesses,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:08.320
with Zuras at the center, it left the&nbsp;
leader particularly vulnerable. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:12.000
the Celestials struck the Uni-Mind&nbsp;
with a powerful bolt of energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:19.819
Zuras was killed. Thena assumed command as&nbsp;
Prime Eternal, until she was forced to abdicate.

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:25.280
Ikaris, one of the most hot-headed Eternals,&nbsp;
never accepted Thena as the Prime Eternal.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:31.840
And he carried quite a bit of sway in Olympia.&nbsp;
He repeatedly challenged Thena for her throne.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:37.680
And though Ikaris was unsuccessful, Thena&nbsp;
struggled mightily with the responsibility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:43.520
suddenly thrust upon her. She struggled with&nbsp;
the idea that the same fate that met her father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:49.600
might await her and suffered beneath the weight&nbsp;
of being without her father for the first time.

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:55.120
It also didn't help that Kro had placed a&nbsp;
device on her that very subtly manipulated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:59.760
her decision-making to favor the Deviants.&nbsp;
Thena was dedicated to keeping her people safe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:05.520
but her love for Kro, the influence of&nbsp;
his device, and her general anxiety came&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:10.800
to a disastrous head when she attacked&nbsp;
Ikaris to save Kro from certain death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:15.840
Ikaris took the opening, defeated&nbsp;
Thena, and took over as Prime Eternal.

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:21.680
Thena was one of the many Eternals who had&nbsp;
their memory wiped when the Eternal Sprite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:28.400
manipulated reality. Totally ignorant of her&nbsp;
past and powers, Thena lived life as a human&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:34.480
researcher, working for Stark Enterprises. She&nbsp;
was knocked out of her mortal reverie by Ikaris,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:38.720
who had broken Sprite's spell and needed&nbsp;
the help of the remaining Eternals to stop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:45.280
another Celestial plot. While living as a human&nbsp;
named Ike Harris, Ikaris had been captured and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:51.760
vaporized by Deviants. When his body reformed&nbsp;
in the Eternals' abandoned city of Olympia,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:56.560
he realized that all of the Eternals were&nbsp;
suffering a similar case of memory loss.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:57.840
"We need to find the others."

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:02.480
Thena and Ikaris traveled around the&nbsp;
world to find their former companions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:08.480
all living as everyday humans, and eventually&nbsp;
stopped the emergence of a sleeping Celestial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:14.000
living underneath Los Angeles. After their&nbsp;
victory, Thena decided to live alongside the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:18.800
human son she'd had in the interim, over&nbsp;
the objections of her fellow Eternals.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:27.840
After millennia of life, Thena died alongside all&nbsp;
the other Eternals in a 2018 "Avengers" story.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:31.840
A group known as the Dark Celestials&nbsp;
attacked Earth while the bodies of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:37.520
regular Celestials began to rain down upon the&nbsp;
planet. Tony Stark traveled to Olympia to check&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:42.320
on the Celestials' most famous experiments,&nbsp;
and found the dead bodies of the Eternals.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:47.040
In a dying monologue, Ikaris explained&nbsp;
that the Eternals weren't sent to Earth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:50.880
to protect humanity: At the beginning&nbsp;
of the attack, they learned that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:57.200
were placed on Earth to cultivate humanity&nbsp;
as a viral weapon. Ikaris tells Iron Man,

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:05.120
"We are a lie, Tony Stark. We Eternals were great&nbsp;
fools. We weren't here to protect you. We were ...&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:12.960
to cultivate you. Your ... virulence. To them, to&nbsp;
the space gods, you ... are a useful pathogen."

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:20.560
This knowledge drove the Eternals mad. As Ikaris&nbsp;
lamented, they couldn't handle learning the truth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:27.280
and it destroyed them. Of course, this is&nbsp;
comics, so all the Eternals, including Thena,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:30.640
came back to life in the 2021 "Eternals" series.

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:37.760
The Eternals are one of Marvel's more obscure&nbsp;
properties, and yet, an Eternals movie came to be,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:43.120
meaning people around the world will&nbsp;
soon know all about Ikaris, Sersi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:49.040
and all the rest of the gang. That includes&nbsp;
Thena, who will be played by Angelina Jolie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:52.720
one of the most famous actresses on the planet.

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:53.220
"Hi."

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:54.960
"Hello."

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:59.680
Jolie has said she's committed to bringing&nbsp;
a realistic version of the immortal warrior&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:05.200
goddess to the silver screen. As she told USA&nbsp;
Today, she's explored everything from ballet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:10.720
to swordsmanship in an effort to get the&nbsp;
graceful fighting of Thena down. She said:

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:13.680
"She's a warrior. I'm going to have to work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:17.840
very hard to give the Marvel Cinematic&nbsp;
Universe the Thena they deserve."

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:23.920
Thena is a one-of-a-kind character who&nbsp;
deserves an actress of Jolie's caliber.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:27.280
She might be soft-hearted&nbsp;
enough to fall for a Deviant,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:32.160
but so too is she a legendary&nbsp;
scholar, warrior, and leader.

